# AMS Builds — environment variables
# IMPORTANT: No environment variables are required to build or run this site.
# EVERYTHING (brand, contact info, hero, Google Search Console verification tag,
# GA4 measurement ID, AdSense toggle + publisher ID, navigation, footer) is
# managed from Decap CMS at /admin/ via src/content/settings/site.yml.
#
# This file is kept only as a reference. If you ever prefer NOT to use the CMS,
# you can edit src/content/settings/site.yml by hand — it is plain YAML.
